{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Warrior Girl 2</strong> is a comical JRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiora, the 16-year-old heroine of the first game, has now grown into a 20-year-old warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four years after defeating the orcs, an even stronger invasion begins.<br>The rural villages on the outskirts of the kingdom are being devastated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has mobilized every possible means to repel the orcs, but ultimately fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearing that the orc raids have begun again, Fiora sets out on a long journey and makes her way to the royal palace\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiora embarks on a reckless adventure into the orcs\u2019 lair, filled with more powerful enemies and dangerous traps than ever before.<br>Will she be able to defeat the orcs and protect the villagers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>very simple, classic JRPG</strong>.<br>Traps lurk everywhere to threaten Fiora, so you must carefully talk to people and investigate your surroundings to track down the orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: Arrow Keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk: Spacebar</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966950?t=1757295043","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966950/3d33ea60f3a3b3e9f52db1c8cf00940484490944/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757295043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966950/a54d74f874b61922b1899b36686fa7794b5c1a62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757295043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966950/a54d74f874b61922b1899b36686fa7794b5c1a62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757295043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Warrior Girl 2</strong> is a comical JRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiora, the 16-year-old heroine of the first game, has now grown into a 20-year-old warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four years after defeating the orcs, an even stronger invasion begins.<br>The rural villages on the outskirts of the kingdom are being devastated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has mobilized every possible means to repel the orcs, but ultimately fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearing that the orc raids have begun again, Fiora sets out on a long journey and makes her way to the royal palace\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiora embarks on a reckless adventure into the orcs\u2019 lair, filled with more powerful enemies and dangerous traps than ever before.<br>Will she be able to defeat the orcs and protect the villagers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>very simple, classic JRPG</strong>.<br>Traps lurk everywhere to threaten Fiora, so you must carefully talk to people and investigate your surroundings to track down the orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: Arrow Keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk: Spacebar</p></li></ul>","developers":["SEO SOFT"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966950/2e1f3e4a6d0235022a6583e0b410ae33e39554b6/header.jpg?t=1757295043","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul